      "text": "RPM\nGCRA over requests. With\nrpm=100 and burst=1.0 a\ntenant may spend 100 at\nonce, then refills one\nevery 600 ms.\n\nTPM\nA cost-weighted bucket.\nGCRA has no cell for 'N\ntokens', so this is a small\natomic bucket instead.\n\nBudget\nAdmission counts the\nestimate before dispatch,\nso a burst cannot overrun\nthe ceiling by one request.",
      "originalText": "RPM\nGCRA over requests. With\nrpm=100 and burst=1.0 a\ntenant may spend 100 at\nonce, then refills one\nevery 600 ms.\n\nTPM\nA cost-weighted bucket.\nGCRA has no cell for 'N\ntokens', so this is a small\natomic bucket instead.\n\nBudget\nAdmission counts the\nestimate before dispatch,\nso a burst cannot overrun\nthe ceiling by one request.",
